t in that purple color of  the zero negative two  three vector and then last but not least  you're going to have three  of the plus three of them i'll do that  in yellow  the zero negative four  one vector now we just quote do the math  so when you apply zero times all of this  you're just going to have a 0 0  0 vector so we can those all go away and  then you are  left with let's see this one is going to  be  2 times 0 is 0. 2 times negative 2 is  negative 4.  2 times 3 is 6. you're going to have  that  plus 3 times 0  is 0. 3 times negative 4 is negative 12.  3 times 1 is 3. i could have written  this a little bit neater but hopefully  you get the idea  and then when we add those two things 0  plus 0  is 0. negative 4 plus negative 12  is negative 16. 6  plus 3 is 9.  and we're done we have just completed  the composition  of a of b
 

